    }
  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Alright, let's convert that exact thinking into code.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4020,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 121,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "First, LONGER starts at zero.",
      "start_ms": 4780,
      "end_ms": 7420,
      "start_frame": 143,
      "end_frame": 223,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we go through every number in the array.",
      "start_ms": 8100,
      "end_ms": 11220,
      "start_frame": 243,
      "end_frame": 337,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "For each number, we treat it as a possible beginning.",
      "start_ms": 11900,
      "end_ms": 15460,
      "start_frame": 357,
      "end_frame": 464,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So current starts from that number, and length starts from one.",
      "start_ms": 16160,
      "end_ms": 20360,
      "start_frame": 485,
      "end_frame": 611,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Now comes our repeated search.",
      "start_ms": 21060,
      "end_ms": 22920,
      "start_frame": 632,
      "end_frame": 688,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "While current, plus one exists in nums, move current forward by one.",
      "start_ms": 23340,
      "end_ms": 28580,
      "start_frame": 700,
      "end_frame": 857,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "And increase the length.",
      "start_ms": 28580,
      "end_ms": 30420,
      "start_frame": 857,
      "end_frame": 913,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "When the next value is missing, that sequence ends.",
      "start_ms": 31180,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "start_frame": 935,
      "end_frame": 1035,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Then compare.",
      "start_ms": 34920,
      "end_ms": 35820,
      "start_frame": 1048,
      "end_frame": 1075,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "This length with longest.",
      "start_ms": 36780,
      "end_ms": 38100,
      "start_frame": 1103,
      "end_frame": 1143,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "And keep the bigger one.",
      "start_ms": 38720,
      "end_ms": 39900,
      "start_frame": 1162,
      "end_frame": 1197,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "At the end, return longest.",
      "start_ms": 40680,
      "end_ms": 42660,
      "start_frame": 1220,
      "end_frame": 1280,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The code is simple.",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 44460,
      "start_frame": 1301,
      "end_frame": 1334,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "But see this line.",
      "start_ms": 45100,
      "end_ms": 46220,
      "start_frame": 1353,
      "end_frame": 1387,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Current plus one in nums.",
      "start_ms": 46880,
      "end_ms": 48840,
      "start_frame": 1406,
      "end_frame": 1465,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Nums is a normal Python list.",
      "start_ms": 49120,
      "end_ms": 51180,
      "start_frame": 1474,
      "end_frame": 1535,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "So Python may have to walk through the list to find that value.",
      "start_ms": 51700,
      "end_ms": 55460,
      "start_frame": 1551,
      "end_frame": 1664,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "And this check can happen again.",
      "start_ms": 55860,
      "end_ms": 58240,
      "start_frame": 1676,
      "end_frame": 1747,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "And again.",
      "start_ms": 59180,
      "end_ms": 60140,
      "start_frame": 1775,
      "end_frame": 1804,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "And again.",
      "start_ms": 60980,
      "end_ms": 61800,
      "start_frame": 1829,
      "end_frame": 1854,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "For many starting numbers.",
      "start_ms": 62660,
      "end_ms": 64320,
      "start_frame": 1880,
      "end_frame": 1930,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "That is where the brute force becomes expensive.",
      "start_ms": 65220,
      "end_ms": 69300,
      "start_frame": 1957,
      "end_frame": 2079,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
